    t: "13 Related pages Features › Brain: the same brain from the user's side, screen by screen. Issues and risks: the three problems above are tracked there with status and Linear links. Decisions and plans: open question on merging the two search implementations. Tests and checks: how to reproduce the unwanted Slack data, to be written for ROA-18. Integrations: Slack, Fathom, Fireflies, ROAS Portal, Gemini.",
